{"pageid":4339,"title":"Heavenly Shrine","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Heavenly Shrine</span>","revid":21841,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice\" style=\"border-radius:15px; border:3px solid #1482f7; background:#0c3b6e; font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n \n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"10\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1d/Hexagon_Incorrect.png/revision/latest?cb=20250626004548\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Incorrect\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1d/Hexagon_Incorrect.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20250626004548\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Incorrect.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Incorrect.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><p style=\"margin-top:0.7em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:bold\">This page may contain <i>missing</i> or <i>inaccurate</i> information!</span><br />\n</p><p><span>Certain information in this page is missing or may contain inaccurate information. If you can cite where this particular information comes from, please add a citation - especially with percent calculations! The list following this notice denotes important potential inaccuracies and omissions.\n</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Heavenly Shrine</b> is a unique structure in <i>Oaklands</i> located in <a href=\"/wiki/Snowy_peaks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowy peaks\">Snowy Peaks</a> that serves as the primary method of spawning the rare <b><a href=\"/wiki/Heavenly_Tree\" title=\"Heavenly Tree\">Heavenly Tree</a></b>. It uses a sundial and compass mechanism that activates several times per in-game day, each giving a small chance to generate a tree somewhere on the map.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Heavenly Shrine</b> is a large sundial with five openings. As the sun moves across the sky, its light shines through these holes at specific times of day, causing the shrine to activate. When this happens, there is a 10% chance that a <a href=\"/wiki/Heavenly_Tree\" title=\"Heavenly Tree\">Heavenly Tree</a> will spawn somewhere in the world. The shrine can activate up to five times per in-game day, meaning five opportunities for a tree to appear.\n</p><p>In addition to the sundial, the shrine also features a compass-like device. When a Heavenly Tree successfully spawns, the compass begins to glow and points in the direction of the tree’s location. This allows players to track the tree more easily, though careful searching is still required to locate it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Activation\">Activation</span></h2>\n<p>The Heavenly Shrine only functions on <b>Saturdays EST</b>. On this day, the sun passes through the five holes of the sundial at fixed intervals, causing the shrine to activate. Each activation provides a 10% chance for a <a href=\"/wiki/Heavenly_Tree\" title=\"Heavenly Tree\">Heavenly Tree</a> to spawn somewhere on the map.\n</p><p>The five activation times occur at <b>07:00, 09:30, 12:00, 14:30, and 17:00</b> in-game time. A maximum of five activations can occur during the day, giving players up to five separate chances to generate a Heavenly Tree each in-game day.\n</p><p>When a Heavenly Tree is successfully spawned and remains on the map, one of the shrine’s pillars will glow. The glowing pillar corresponds to the direction of the tree, acting as a compass to guide players toward its location.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ea/Map2.png/revision/latest?cb=20251101173103\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Map\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ea/Map2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251101173103\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"149\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Map2.png\" data-image-key=\"Map2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Map2.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Directions to help locate trees</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Halloweenly\">Halloweenly</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 264px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/79/Heavenly_shrine_corrupted.png/revision/latest?cb=20251012191303\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Heavenly shrine corrupted\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/79/Heavenly_shrine_corrupted.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/264?cb=20251012191303\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"264\" height=\"125\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Heavenly shrine corrupted.png\" data-image-key=\"Heavenly_shrine_corrupted.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Heavenly_shrine_corrupted.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p>During the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Halloween_Event\" title=\"2025 Halloween Event\">2025 Halloween Event</a>, the <b>Heavenly Shrine</b> is partially corrupted.\n</p><p>When the sun aligns at the second and third rings of the sundial, exactly as <b>9:30</b> and <b>12:00</b> respectively, will activate the Heavenly Shrine with a purple glow and attempts to spawn a <a href=\"/wiki/Halloweenly\" title=\"Halloweenly\">Halloweenly</a> instead.\n</p><p>When a Halloweenly is successfully spawned and remains on the map, the glowing pillar that corresponds to the direction will have a purple glow instead.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Heavenly Shrine is the only structure in Oaklands that uses the sun’s position to function.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>It is the sole method of spawning the Heavenly Tree and Halloweenly.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>It is the only structure that functions at a specific day of the week.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Locations_Nav\" title=\"Template:Locations Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Locations_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Locations_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=202210252333